A '''Nursery Aide''' (Japanese: '''ほいくし''' ''Kindergarten Teacher'') is a type of {{DL|Pokémon Trainer|Trainer class}} introduced in [[Generation V]]. They are normally found near {{tc|Preschooler}}s. They can be considered a different version of the {{tc|Teacher}} Trainer class. Some <!--Why plural??-->will give out [[Rare Candy|Rare Candies]] when defeated. They normally use Pokémon from a variety of different [[type]]s. In the [[Battle Subway]], they specialize in [[Eeveelution]]s, and in the early stages, either {{type|Dragon}} Pokémon or the final evolved forms of [[first partner Pokémon]].

