==In animation==
[[File:Penelope XY013.png|thumb|250px|Penelope, a Kindergarten Teacher from the {{aniseries|XY|''XY'' series}}]]
==={{aniseries|BW}}===
[[Daniela]], a [[character of the day]] who appeared in ''[[BW012|Here Comes the Trubbish Squad!]]'', is based on this Trainer class, due to the Japanese name of the class. She was shown to run a kindergarten located [[Unova Route 3|somewhere]] between [[Striaton City]] and [[Nacrene City]].

==={{aniseries|XY}}===
Another Kindergarten Teacher, {{OBP|Penelope|XY013}}, appeared in ''[[XY013|Kindergarten Chaos!]]''. She works in a kindergarten [[Kalos Route 6|somewhere]] between [[Lumiose City]] and [[Camphrier Town]].
{{-}}

