{{-}}

==Trivia==
[[File:B2W2 Nursery Aide June.png|thumb|256px|Nursery Aide June's dialogue in the Japanese versions]]
* In the Japanese, French, German, Spanish, and Korean versions of Black 2 and White 2, Nursery Aide June tells the player that he's a man, but [[Cross-dressing|dresses as a woman]] since his employer only hires women and would only hire him on the condition that he dressed as a woman. This dialogue appears after riding the Ferris wheel together at least twice, and is edited in the English and Italian versions so that June's employer was instead looking for people with more experience.
{{-}}

